Sleeves:
1. Multi-asset time-series trend.
2. Cross-sectional relative momentum.
3. Breakout/volume/funding event continuation.

Candidate selection uses 2021-2022 development and 2023 validation only.
2024-2026H1 is an untouched final holdout. Execution is next 4H open,
with symbol-level settled funding and turnover costs.
"""
